      "id": "404c7b08",
      "agent_input": "Please load the data from data/sales_q3.csv and filter for won deals by James Okafor and Sofia Delgado, specifically D001, D002, D003, D005, D006, and D008. I\u2019d like to see their actual amounts and close dates so I can draft the summary.",
      "agent_response": {
        "response": "Here are the verified results from `sales_q3.csv` for the six won deals you requested:\n\n| Deal ID | Rep | Product | Amount | Close Date | Status |\n|---------|-----|---------|--------|------------|--------|\n| D001 | James Okafor | Meridian Insights Pro | $87,500 | 2026-07-05 | Won |\n| D002 | Sofia Delgado | Meridian Insights Pro | $62,000 | 2026-07-08 | Won |\n| D003 | James Okafor | Meridian DataBridge | $43,000 | 2026-07-12 | Won |\n| D005 | Sofia Delgado | Meridian DataBridge | $55,000 | 2026-07-19 | Won |\n| D006 | James Okafor | Meridian Insights Pro | $120,000 | 2026-07-22 | Won |\n| D008 | Sofia Delgado | Meridian DataBridge | $38,000 | 2026-08-02 | Won |\n\n**Per-Rep Breakdown:**\n\n- **James Okafor** \u2014 3 deals (D001, D003, D006) totaling **$250,500**, closed Jul 5 \u2013 Jul 22\n- **Sofia Delgado** \u2014 3 deals (D002, D005, D008) totaling **$155,000**, closed Jul 8 \u2013 Aug 2\n\n**Combined total across all 6 deals: $405,500**\n\nA few things worth noting for your summary draft:\n- James Okafor's largest deal was **D006 at $120,000** (Meridian Insights Pro, South region).\n- Sofia Delgado's largest was **D002 at $62,000** (Meridian Insights Pro, South region).\n- Product mix: James sold 2\u00d7 Insights Pro + 1\u00d7 DataBridge; Sofia sold 1\u00d7 Insights Pro + 2\u00d7 DataBridge.\n- All six deals closed within a ~4-week window (Jul 5 \u2013 Aug 2).\n\nLet me know if you'd like me to draft the summary document itself!",
        "status_code": null
      },
